# Every landing touches the changelog, so parallel branches conflict on it and
# on the mirror pkg/docs embeds. Union merge keeps both sides' [Unreleased]
# bullets and resolves the merge unattended. DELIVERY.md names the two cases it
# gets wrong.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
pkg/docs/changelog.md merge=union

# Tools compare generated files and formatted source byte for byte.
*.sh text eol=lf
.shellcheckrc text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
.apidiff/*.txt text eol=lf
api/openapi.yaml text eol=lf
